<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(d) </span></figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span>Label distributions used for memorization scoring: balanced bins across languages confirm that score variations are not due to class imbalance.</figcaption>
</figure>
